### Compared to Previous Winters

```{r snow-percentile}
#| output: asis
pct <- snow_summary$snow_pct_rank
if (!is.na(pct)) {
  direction <- if (pct >= 50) "snowier" else "less snowy"
  cat(glue('<div class="tp-percentile" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">',
           'This season has been <strong>{direction} than {pct}%</strong> ',
           'of winters since {year(WEATHER_START)}.',
           '</div>'))
}
```

